### 2b. Activity Diagram — Virtual Tour

```plantuml
@startuml
skinparam ActivityBackgroundColor #f9f7f4
skinparam ActivityBorderColor #3E352B
skinparam ArrowColor #4a5942

start

:Pengguna membuka /tour;
:TourPage merender VirtualMuseum;
:Three.js Canvas diinisialisasi;
:PerspectiveCamera (fov=75) dibuat;
:OrbitControls diaktifkan\n(enableZoom=false, enablePan=false);
:currentRoomId = 'burung1';

:Suspense: Loading Overlay tampil;
:RoomSphereMap memuat PANO_20251124_121533.jpg;
:Texture dipasang ke SphereGeometry (BackSide);
