### 3c. Sequence — Mengikuti Kuis

```plantuml
@startuml
skinparam SequenceArrowColor #4a5942
skinparam SequenceParticipantBackgroundColor #f9f7f4
skinparam SequenceParticipantBorderColor #3E352B

actor "Pengunjung" as User
participant "Browser\n(Next.js Client)" as Browser
participant "Next.js App Router" as Router
participant "ZoologyQuiz.tsx\n(React Component)" as Quiz
participant "quiz.ts\n(Static Data)" as Data
participant "GSAP\n(Animation)" as GSAP
participant "html2canvas\n(Library)" as H2C

User -> Browser : Membuka /kuis
Browser -> Router : HTTP GET /kuis
Router --> Browser : Render QuizPage → ZoologyQuiz

Browser -> Quiz : Mount ZoologyQuiz
Quiz -> Quiz : gameState = 'welcome'
Quiz -> GSAP : gsap.fromTo(.content-anim, opacity 0→1, y 30→0)
Browser --> User : Welcome screen tampil

User -> Browser : Klik "Mulai Kuis"
Browser -> Quiz : goToChapters()
Quiz -> Quiz : gameState = 'chapters'
Quiz -> Data : Baca QUIZ_CATEGORIES[]
Data --> Quiz : Array 5 kategori
Browser --> User : Chapter selection tampil\n(Seluruh Area + 5 kategori)

User -> Browser : Pilih kategori (mis: Mamalia)
Browser -> Quiz : startChapter(category)
Quiz -> Data : Filter ZOOLOGY_QUIZ_DATA\nby categoryId === 'mamalia'
Data --> Quiz : Array soal terfilter
Quiz -> Quiz : gameState = 'playing'\ncurrentQuestionIndex = 0, score = 0
Browser --> User : Soal pertama tampil

loop Setiap soal
  User -> Browser : Klik salah satu opsi
  Browser -> Quiz : handleOptionClick(option)
  Quiz -> Quiz : Cek option === correctAnswer
  alt Benar
    Quiz -> Quiz : score + 1
    Quiz -> Quiz : isCorrect = true
  else Salah
    Quiz -> Quiz : isCorrect = false
  end
  Quiz -> Quiz : setTimeout 400ms\nshowFact = true
  Quiz -> GSAP : gsap.fromTo(feedbackRef,\nscale 0.8→1, y 20→0)
  Browser --> User : Panel "Tahukah Kamu?" tampil
  
  User -> Browser : Klik "Soal Berikutnya"
  Browser -> Quiz : nextQuestion()
  Quiz -> GSAP : gsap.to(questionRef, {x:-50, opacity:0})
  Quiz -> Quiz : currentQuestionIndex + 1
  Quiz -> GSAP : gsap.fromTo(questionRef, {x:50}→{x:0})
  Browser --> User : Soal berikutnya tampil
end

Quiz -> Quiz : gameState = 'result'
Browser --> User : Layar "Misi Selesai!"\n+ form isi nama

User -> Browser : Mengisi nama & submit
Browser -> Quiz : setPlayerName(name)
Quiz -> Quiz : Render Sertifikat (div 800x800px)\n+ Predikat berdasarkan score

Browser --> User : Sertifikat ditampilkan

User -> Browser : Klik "Unduh Gambar (PNG)"
Browser -> Quiz : handleDownloadCertificate()
Quiz -> Quiz : import('html2canvas') (dynamic)
Quiz -> H2C : html2canvas(certificateRef, {scale:2})
H2C --> Quiz : canvas element
Quiz -> Browser : link.href = canvas.toDataURL('image/png')\nlink.click()
Browser --> User : File PNG terunduh\n(Sertifikat-MZB-[nama].png)

@enduml
```

