### 3d. Sequence — Mengirim Evaluasi

```plantuml
@startuml
skinparam SequenceArrowColor #4a5942
skinparam SequenceParticipantBackgroundColor #f9f7f4
skinparam SequenceParticipantBorderColor #3E352B

actor "Pengunjung" as User
participant "Browser\n(Next.js Client)" as Browser
participant "Next.js App Router" as Router
participant "EvaluationForm.tsx\n(React Component)" as Form
participant "Formspree API\n(External Service)" as Formspree

User -> Browser : Membuka /evaluasi
Browser -> Router : HTTP GET /evaluasi
Router --> Browser : Render EvaluasiPage → EvaluationForm
Browser --> User : Form 4 bagian tampil

User -> Browser : Mengisi Bagian 1: Profil\n(Nama, Usia, Kunjungan Pertama)
User -> Browser : Mengisi Bagian 2: UX & Visual\n(Rating bintang Kemudahan + Tampilan)
Browser -> Form : handleStarClick(category, value)
Form -> Form : ratings state diperbarui

User -> Browser : Mengisi Bagian 3: Evaluasi Fitur\n(Rating Galeri, Kuis, Dampak Pengamatan)
User -> Browser : Mengisi Bagian 4: Kesimpulan\n(NPS 1-10, Fitur Favorit, Kendala, Saran, Ide Riil)

User -> Browser : Klik "Kirim Evaluasi"
Browser -> Form : handleSubmit(e)
Form -> Form : e.preventDefault()\nsetIsSubmitting(true)
Form -> Form : new FormData(form)
Form -> Formspree : HTTP POST https://formspree.io/f/mnjkdrkg\n(body: FormData, Accept: application/json)

alt response.ok
  Formspree --> Form : HTTP 200 OK
  Form -> Form : setIsSuccess(true)\nform.reset()\nratings direset ke 0
  Browser --> User : Tampilan "Terima Kasih!" dengan ikon centang
else response error
  Formspree --> Form : HTTP error
  Form --> Browser : alert("Terjadi kesalahan saat mengirim data.")
  Browser --> User : Alert error tampil
end

@enduml
```

